  "notes": "Owner's zone review 2026-11-19 (Zone Reviews doc): banditry in the north-west and south-west woods, the fae around Mardagh and the western pond, a haunted north-east tied to the Parthanan Farm and the barrow by Mag Mell, the Dergan and their allies in the south-east with an elite island, pests feuding in the hills north of Mag Mell, beetles on every shore, curmudgeons with their mudmen. Coordinates are zone-local units (0..65535, x east, y south). Density pass 2 (2026-11-21, the Lough Derg plan): camps spaced by con with bodyguards, more patrols (highway robbers, curmudgeon cart, Dergan war band, wolf packs), a night procession and night spawns in the haunted north-east, wildlife on the east shore, and the western mere as a fae stronghold with the Lady of the Mere.",
